**Security notes:**
- [ ] OpenAI API key only in server-side `route.ts`, never in client bundle
- [ ] Client calls `/api/chat` (our endpoint), not OpenAI directly
- [ ] Server proxy: authenticate (NextAuth session) → validate (Zod schema) → rate-limit → call OpenAI → stream back
- [ ] No `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` — uses React text interpolation
- [ ] Input validated server-side (max 4000 chars, max 20 messages)
- [ ] Rate limiting per authenticated user
- [ ] Structured logging with userId, no secrets logged
- [ ] Session cookie: HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite (via NextAuth defaults)
